    "body": "1. Refactors the current code to migrate to app-platform simple App.\r\n2. Fixes some mess in the alerting module that unintentionally imports grafana modules because some wrong references\r\n3. Updates make file with some useful commands (copied from dashboard app)\r\n4. https://github.com/grafana/grafana/pull/104424/commits/ad4f885cfb93b3fa6ddc1859db2277cded179499 adds support for field selectors to the app's api builder. It just makes selectors pass the K8s API middleware. The selectors should be supported by the store.",
